{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33954","headline":"以纱巾寄鲁望因而有作 · 皮日休","name":"以纱巾寄鲁望因而有作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"周家新样替三梁，裹髪偏宜白面郎。\n掩歛乍疑裁黑雾，轻明浑似戴玄霜。\n今朝定见看花昃，明日应闻漉酒香。\n更有一般君未识，虎文巾在绦霄房。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33954.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33954","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}